    "body": "Complete the user-selected onboarding flow after the six-question gate.\n\n- unlock the normal world immediately after question six\n- show an immediate branch-aware Rayhan injection based on the first-round branch and second-round choice\n- create the first real incoming argument battle through the existing `Game.Conflict.incoming(...)` API\n- tag the battle with a stable Stage 7 bridge ID and causal branch metadata\n- preserve exactly-once behavior under synchronous UI re-rendering\n- recover an active bridge battle after refresh without duplicating an existing battle\n- persist `pending -> created -> completed` lifecycle so a finished battle never replays after refresh\n- leave ordinary conflict resolution, economy, argument pools, and post-battle play unchanged\n- realign three stale Stage 7 regression contracts with the already-merged three-NPC/six-question flow and current Rayhan/Nastya names\n\nValidation:\n- source/docs JS and index mirror parity\n- Node syntax\n- Stage 7 first causal slice\n- observed-evidence harness\n- personalization\n- essence modal and pre-start overlay\n- dynamic Stage 7.8 harness covering all three branches, foreground/return, six-question unlock, real incoming battle, reentrant render, active-battle recovery, and completed-battle no-replay\n- `git diff --check`\n\nExact scope: four runtime mirror/entrypoint files and four Stage 7 regression files. No conflict-core/API mutation and no network transmission.",
